#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Mobile: local and international flights worldwide.
- Every airport in the world with scheduled passenger flights is searchable:
  4,008 airports in 233 countries, so local (domestic) flights can be booked in
  any country - Africa, Europe, Middle East, North America, Asia, Oceania and
  South America - as well as international ones.
- 24 Nigerian airports are listed first as "Nigeria (domestic)".
- Search by city, airport name, country (e.g. "Kenya", "USA", "UK") or code.
  Any 3-letter IATA code can still be typed in.
- Domestic popular routes and route times.
Works whether or not you installed the earlier flights update.

Unzip in the mobile project root (with app.json), then:
    python3 apply_flights_world_mobile.py
"""
